{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22840","headline":"早春闻提壶鸟因题邻家 · 白居易","name":"早春闻提壶鸟因题邻家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"厌听秋猨催下泪，喜闻春鸟劝提壶。\n谁家红树先花发，何处青楼有酒酤。\n进士麄豪寻静尽，拾遗风采近都无。\n欲期明日东邻醉，变作腾腾一俗夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}